{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近日，網上流傳一段引發熱議的短片。影片中，一名女乘客疑似在港鐵車廂內吸食電子煙，隨即被同車的多名乘客當場揭發並出言指責。港鐵職員接報後迅速趕到現場，要求該名女子一同離開車廂，豈料遭到對方堅決拒絕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4a6557de-5582-478a-836e-de9a3f835c3d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20263caYbWzKXZ1788840028.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4a6557de-5582-478a-836e-de9a3f835c3d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">面對眾人的質疑，該名女子態度強硬，堅稱自己並未違規。她更當場反問：「我沒有吸煙，我為甚麼要無故在這裡吸煙？」然而，影片畫面拍攝到，該名女子當時手上正拿著一件疑似電子煙的物品。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e9d3d3d7-9380-49b6-a453-40659a3fbfb5.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026gRWzMfo9PJ1788840027.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e9d3d3d7-9380-49b6-a453-40659a3fbfb5.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b6ce8adf-98a3-4e05-a1e5-24d3bb59fc5f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026QdcT90gWAx1788840028.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b6ce8adf-98a3-4e05-a1e5-24d3bb59fc5f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">儘管現場有多名乘客紛紛發聲譴責其行為，該名女子依然無動於衷，堅決不肯下車，隨後更自顧自地低頭繼續玩手機。事件僵持片刻後，港鐵職員再次進入車廂對其進行勸喻，並再次要求她離開，該名女子最終才妥協，跟隨職員離去。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T05:18:01.265558+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}